      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.boh_isaac.amelineau_ed:42-48",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲣⲱⲙⲉ ⲅⲁⲣ ⲛⲓⲙ ⲉⲧⲉⲣⲉⲡⲣⲱⲙⲉ ⲙⲡⲉⲧⲟⲩⲁⲁⲃ ⲛⲁⲥⲟⲟⲩⲧⲛ ⲉⲃⲟⲗ ⲛⲧⲉϥϭⲓϫ ⲛϥⲥⲫⲣⲁⲅⲓⲍⲉ ⲙⲙⲟⲟⲩ ⲉⲩϣⲟⲟⲡ ϩⲛ**ϣⲱⲛⲉ** ⲛⲓⲙ · ϣⲁⲩⲗⲟ ⲛⲧⲉⲩⲛⲟⲩ ·",
      "english": "And in every man who was sick, no matter of what kind his sickness might be, immediately the holy man Apa Pisentius stretched out his hand over him, and made the Sign of the Cross over him, the sickness ceased.",
